body: "Coverage must exercise public behavior and real SDK-host dispatch where applicable. Do not ignore source paths, lower thresholds, use vacuous assertions, or duplicate tests merely to satisfy counters. Baseline was measured against both generated runtime modules after the SDK context review fixes."
